{"3919900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Zone Revive", "steam_appid": 3919900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A LEGENDARY GAME FROM 2012 IS BACK!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After its shutdown in 2021, Dead Zone returns fully revived!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/bda5992f2d75cfa5762e1733bfbf4fa4.avif?t=1783095094\" width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>REBUILD THE ULTIMATE SURVIVAL BASE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build production, defensive, decorative buildings and more unlocks along the way to fortify your base against hordes of the undead and your fellow survivors alike. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/3ed108815ef3c97b5dbb4e4b34099830.avif?t=1783095094\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MANY CLASSES TO ASSEMBLE YOUR ULTIMATE TEAM</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you need? A doctor to heal you? A fast looter? A powerful fighter? A swift scout? A front-line engineer?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/d9ee8863a58bfc187ded012fdbaf810a.avif?t=1783095094\" width=876 height=382 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>LEVEL UP AND GET STRONGER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, equip better weapons, and increase your stats. You can be the ultimate survivor. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/8ef6557cc392fd3679ea03a3df0423d3.avif?t=1783095094\" width=973 height=607 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>THOUSANDS OF CRAFTABLE AND LOOTABLE ITEMS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, gear, resources. All this with an irresistible rarity system. (No pay to win)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/4eb1110ec86f39f582e81c74c36ab5f1.avif?t=1783095094\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FORM AN ALLIANCE AND EARN REWARDS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances with your friends, wage wars, complete tasks, and earn valuable rewards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/fa97b4a9b52c47a998df6b3959bc1742.avif?t=1783095094\" width=754 height=510 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/743429684599f7ba76d11a583c6e95b1.avif?t=1783095094\" width=752 height=512 /></span><strong><i><u>“Dead Zone Revive is a not-for-profit fan-run project, in agreement with ConArtist Games.”</u></i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A LEGENDARY GAME FROM 2012 IS BACK!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After its shutdown in 2021, Dead Zone returns fully revived!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/bda5992f2d75cfa5762e1733bfbf4fa4.avif?t=1783095094\" width=1560 height=728 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>REBUILD THE ULTIMATE SURVIVAL BASE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build production, defensive, decorative buildings and more unlocks along the way to fortify your base against hordes of the undead and your fellow survivors alike. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/3ed108815ef3c97b5dbb4e4b34099830.avif?t=1783095094\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MANY CLASSES TO ASSEMBLE YOUR ULTIMATE TEAM</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you need? A doctor to heal you? A fast looter? A powerful fighter? A swift scout? A front-line engineer?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/d9ee8863a58bfc187ded012fdbaf810a.avif?t=1783095094\" width=876 height=382 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>LEVEL UP AND GET STRONGER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, equip better weapons, and increase your stats. You can be the ultimate survivor. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/8ef6557cc392fd3679ea03a3df0423d3.avif?t=1783095094\" width=973 height=607 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>THOUSANDS OF CRAFTABLE AND LOOTABLE ITEMS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, gear, resources. All this with an irresistible rarity system. (No pay to win)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/4eb1110ec86f39f582e81c74c36ab5f1.avif?t=1783095094\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>FORM AN ALLIANCE AND EARN REWARDS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances with your friends, wage wars, complete tasks, and earn valuable rewards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/fa97b4a9b52c47a998df6b3959bc1742.avif?t=1783095094\" width=754 height=510 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/extras/743429684599f7ba76d11a583c6e95b1.avif?t=1783095094\" width=752 height=512 /></span><strong><i><u>“Dead Zone Revive is a not-for-profit fan-run project, in agreement with ConArtist Games.”</u></i></strong></p>", "short_description": "Fight, rebuild, and survive in a zombie apocalypse! Lead your team in real-time missions, gather weapons, gear, and supplies, and defend your base with tactical RPG and strategy gameplay.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/774c0da58c69bb0fecb842dc708d40bd7db22ca1/header.jpg?t=1783095094", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/4c646c03119299010ef17d3f84dea05004974d60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783095094", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919900/4c646c03119299010ef17d3f84dea05004974d60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783095094", "website": "https://deadzonegame.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</